WEBVTT

00:32:25.913 --> 00:32:30.121
So animals are way, way, way more
intelligent than many people used to

00:32:30.121 --> 00:32:32.204
think and some people still
wouldn't believe it.

00:32:32.746 --> 00:32:36.413
But, you know, I can think
of a species that designs

00:32:36.413 --> 00:32:40.663
a rocket that goes to Mars from which a
little robot creeps to take photographs

00:32:41.621 --> 00:32:47.538
for people who think about discover stars
that are billions of light miles away.

00:32:47.538 --> 00:32:52.496
I mean, my goodness. And I think Galileo
back then in those days couldn't think

00:32:52.496 --> 00:32:56.913
of anything else. I mean, the human
intellect has been extraordinary.

00:32:57.288 --> 00:33:03.079
Yeah, yeah. I mean, it's it's it's hard to
it's hard to disagree with with those